{"id":4937,"date":"2020-03-12T13:37:59","date_gmt":"2020-03-12T12:37:59","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/?p=4937"},"modified":"2022-12-02T11:02:43","modified_gmt":"2022-12-02T10:02:43","slug":"wie-gehts","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/wie-gehts\/","title":{"rendered":"Wie geht&rsquo;s ?"},"content":{"rendered":"<p><strong>Le Conseil D\u00e9partemental du Bas-Rhin ouvre une nouvelle ligne d&rsquo;\u00e9coute \u00ab\u00a0Wie geht&rsquo;s ?\u00a0\u00bb :<\/strong><\/p>\n<p><!--more--><br \/>\n<strong>\u00ab\u00a0A\u00een\u00e9s, aidants, wie geht\u2019s ?<\/strong><br \/>\nA\u00een\u00e9s, aidants, comment \u00e7a va ? \u00bb<br \/>\nCette offre est \u00e0 destination du public s\u00e9niors isol\u00e9, \u00e0 domicile ou en EHPAD et des aidants de personnes en perte d\u2019autonomie li\u00e9e \u00e0 l\u2019\u00e2ge ou au handicap (hors Ville de Strasbourg).<br \/>\nLes acteurs locaux et partenaires du domaine de l\u2019autonomie peuvent orienter le public fragilis\u00e9 par la crise sanitaire pour une \u00e9coute et un soutien.<br \/>\nGr\u00e2ce au soutien de la Conf\u00e9rence des financeurs, une \u00e9quipe de 3 psychologues assurent une \u00e9coute par t\u00e9l\u00e9phone, \u00e9cran ou visioconf\u00e9rence, pour une p\u00e9riode de 6 mois.<br \/>\n<strong>La permanence t\u00e9l\u00e9phonique est ouverte de 9h \u00e0 18h :<\/strong><br \/>\n<strong>lundi, mardi, jeudi et vendredi. <\/strong><\/p>\n<p><strong>Un seul num\u00e9ro d\u2019appel : 03.88.76.60.50<\/strong><\/p>\n<p><a href=\"https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/09\/CF-67-logo.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-4939\" src=\"https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/09\/CF-67-logo-300x96.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"253\" height=\"81\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/09\/CF-67-logo-300x96.jpg 300w, https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/09\/CF-67-logo-200x64.jpg 200w, https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/09\/CF-67-logo-276x89.jpg 276w, https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/09\/CF-67-logo.jpg 396w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 253px) 100vw, 253px\" \/><\/a>1212<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Le Conseil D\u00e9partemental du Bas-Rhin ouvre une nouvelle ligne d&rsquo;\u00e9coute \u00ab\u00a0Wie geht&rsquo;s ?\u00a0\u00bb :<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":6,"featured_media":5015,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"_expiration-date-status":"","_expiration-date":0,"_expiration-date-type":"","_expiration-date-categories":[],"_expiration-date-options":[]},"categories":[31,41],"tags":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/4937"}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/6"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=4937"}],"version-history":[{"count":2,"href":"https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/4937\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":6039,"href":"https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/4937\/revisions\/6039"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/5015"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=4937"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"category","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/categories?post=4937"},{"taxonomy":"post_tag","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/tags?post=4937"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api